msgid "(Contributed by Pablo Galindo in :issue:`41064`.)"
msgstr "(Přispěl Pablo Galindo v :issue:`41064`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.10.rst:336
msgid "IndentationErrors"
msgstr "Chyby odsazení"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.10.rst:338
msgid ""
"Many :exc:`IndentationError` exceptions now have more context regarding what"
" kind of block was expecting an indentation, including the location of the "
"statement:"
msgstr ""
"Mnoho výjimek :exc:`IndentationError` nyní má více kontextu ohledně toho, "
"jaký typ bloku očekává odsazení, včetně umístnění příkazu:"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.10.rst:341
msgid ""
">>> def foo():\n"
"...    if lel:\n"
"...    x = 2\n"
"  File \"<stdin>\", line 3\n"
"    x = 2\n"
"    ^\n"
"IndentationError: expected an indented block after 'if' statement in line 2"
msgstr ""
">>> def foo():\n"
"...    if lel:\n"
"...    x = 2\n"
"  File \"<stdin>\", line 3\n"
"    x = 2\n"
"    ^\n"
"IndentationError: expected an indented block after 'if' statement in line 2"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.10.rst:353
msgid "AttributeErrors"
msgstr "Chyby atributů"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.10.rst:355
msgid ""
"When printing :exc:`AttributeError`, :c:func:`!PyErr_Display` will offer "
"suggestions of similar attribute names in the object that the exception was "
"raised from:"
msgstr ""
"Při tisku :exc:`AttributeError` bude :c:func:`!PyErr_Display` nabízet návrhy"
