#: ../../whatsnew/3.10.rst:1091
msgid "enum"
msgstr "enum"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.10.rst:1093
msgid ""
":class:`~enum.Enum` :func:`~object.__repr__` now returns "
"``enum_name.member_name`` and :func:`~object.__str__` now returns "
"``member_name``.  Stdlib enums available as module constants have a "
